_card-sort-40-icon_.svg" alt="_card-sort-40-icon_.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">Card sorting</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Discover how to organize your content with both open and closed card sorting.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/20898421__first-click-40-icon_.svg" alt="_first-click-40-icon_.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">First click testing</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Improve the intuitiveness and effectiveness of a user interface by analyzing where users click first.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/20898415__five-second-test-40-icon_.svg" alt="_five-second-test-40-icon_.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">Five second testing</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Optimize the clarity of your designs or messaging by measuring first impressions.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/20898419__live-website-test-40-icon_.svg" alt="_live-website-test-40-icon_.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">Live website testing</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Discover exactly where and why users struggle as they complete key tasks on live websites.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/20898416__preference-test-40-icon_.svg" alt="_preference-test-40-icon_.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">Preference testing</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Create products your target audience will love by learning what their preferences are early on.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/20898420__prototype-test-40-icon_.svg" alt="_prototype-test-40-icon_.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">Prototype testing</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Discover how users navigate your Figma prototypes so you know what to improve before you ship.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/17338697_recordings.svg" alt="recordings.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">Recordings</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Capture think-aloud with audio, screen, and camera recordings on unmoderated tests.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/11265308_panelicon.svg" alt="panelicon.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">Research panel</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Get on-demand access to 690,000+ panelists. Target by over 395 demographic filters.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/20898418__screener-32-icon_.svg" alt="_screener-32-icon_.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">Screeners</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Ask qualifying questions to make sure participants meet your exact criteria.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/20898422__survey-questions-40-icon_.svg" alt="_survey-questions-40-icon_.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">Surveys</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Make confident decisions by asking questions and validating your assumptions.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/20898423__tree-test-40-icon_.svg" alt="_tree-test-40-icon_.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">Tree Testing</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Assess and refine your information architecture to improve findability.</p></div></div></div><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px] min-w-min"><div class="group flex h-full w-full flex-col justify-between gap-6 4xl:max-w-[410px]"><div class="flex max-w-[410px] grow flex-col"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/11265310_interviewsicon.svg" alt="interviewsicon.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="36" height="36" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md min-w-9 mb-4"/><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s mb-2 font-medium">User interviews</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mb-auto line-clamp-2 text-neutral-02">Easily plan, recruit, schedule, conduct, and analyze user interviews with one streamlined tool.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island><di