s="p-7"><div class="relative aspect-71/68 w-[66px] lg:w-[71px]"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/22127745_school-education.svg" alt="school-education.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 71px, 66px" style="position:absolute;inset:0px;width:100%;height:100%;" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none object-contain"/></div><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-m text-m-heading-m mt-5 hidden font-medium lg:block">For students and educators</h3><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-xs text-m-heading-xs mt-5 font-medium lg:hidden">For students and educators</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mt-2 text-neutral-02">We’re big believers in the value of research in design education so we provide a 25% discount on our subscriptions for all students and educators.</p><a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/book-demo/" data-event-name="link-click-talk-to-sales" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-center mt-4 lg:mt-6 flex-row"><div class="relative overflow-hidden"><span class="font-mint lg:text-button text-m-button block font-medium opacity-0">Talk to sales</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-mint lg:text-button text-m-button absolute left-0 right-0 top-0 block font-medium transition-all duration-500 lg:group-hover:top-[-50px]">Talk to sales</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-mint lg:text-button text-m-button absolute left-0 right-0 top-[50px] block font-medium transition-all duration-500 lg:group-hover:top-0">Talk to sales</span></div><div class="relative h-3 w-3 lg:w-4 ml-2"><svg stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="fill-none w-4 transition-all duration-500 lg:group-hover:translate-x-1"><use href="/_astro/symbols.Rv3yHajH.svg#arrow-narrow-right"></use></svg></div></a></div></div><div class="rounded-md lg:rounded-lg bg-neutral-06"><div class="p-7"><div class="relative aspect-71/68 w-[66px] lg:w-[71px]"><img src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/lyssna-production-marketing-site-assets/main10/22127744_not-for-profit.svg" alt="not-for-profit.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 71px, 66px" style="position:absolute;inset:0px;width:100%;height:100%;" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none object-contain"/></div><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-m text-m-heading-m mt-5 hidden font-medium lg:block">For non-profits and charities</h3><h3 class="font-mint lg:text-heading-xs text-m-heading-xs mt-5 font-medium lg:hidden">For non-profits and charities</h3><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s mt-2 text-neutral-02">We pride ourselves on giving as much as we can to philanthropic efforts. As part of that we offer charities and non-profits a 25% discount on our subscriptions.</p><a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/book-demo/" data-event-name="link-click-talk-to-sales" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-center mt-4 lg:mt-6 flex-row"><div class="relative overflow-hidden"><span class="font-mint lg:text-button text-m-button block font-medium opacity-0">Talk to sales</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-mint lg:text-button text-m-button absolute left-0 right-0 top-0 block font-medium transition-all duration-500 lg:group-hover:top-[-50px]">Talk to sales</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-mint lg:text-button text-m-button absolute left-0 right-0 top-[50px] block font-medium transition-all duration-500 lg:group-hover:top-0">Talk to sales</span></div><div class="relative h-3 w-3 lg:w-4 ml-2"><svg stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="fill-none w-4 transition-all duration-500 lg:group-hover:translate-x-1"><use href="/_astro/symbols.Rv3yHajH.svg#arrow-narrow-right"></use></svg></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island><astro-island uid=